        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turkish Throne invites you to immerse yourself in the intricate world of politics, where you lead your newly established political party in a fierce competition against five major rivals across the nation. Your ultimate goal? Seize power. Invest strategically in election campaigns, organize province visits, and maximize your voter base to secure a parliamentary majority. Rise through the ranks, claim the presidential seat, and navigate crucial decisions amidst a backdrop of diverse events. Will you wield influence and shape the destiny of the nation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make election investments and organise visits to provinces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Work with the right people in the municipal elections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Maximise your votes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Secure a parliamentary majority</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take the presidential seat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Make important decisions against different events</p></li></ul>",
